	(text "RelayBoard — 5ch input + power selector; instantiate twice\nCHn_SET / CHn_RST = coil pulse nets; CHn_*_CMD = MCP to ULN logic.\nAudio and power AZ850 pairs share SET/RESET: 100ms pulse, never hold.\nJP A1/A0 (open=0): 00=0x20 A, 01=0x21 B, 10=0x22 C, 11=0x23 D. A2=GND.\nSilk table next to JP301/JP302 on the PCB.\nJ_TONE = L/R only. Cable shield drains at ControlPanel, not here (J_RAIL has A_GND).\n+5V/D_GND from ControlPanel; contacts switch +/-12V only.\nJ_RAIL = PowerModule J201. A_GND is never switched: straight to each J_PWR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "654099bd-42b7-4dbf-b987-cc80027d4b1b")
	)
